    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/adas-portfolio/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Adas Portfolio is a sleek, modern, and highly responsive Personal Portfolio and Resume WordPress Theme. Crafted with precision for freelancers, developers, designers, photographers, and creative professionals, Adas provides the perfect digital canvas to showcase your skills, experience, and creative projects. With a striking user interface that features a sticky personal profile card and smooth scrolling content, Adas ensures your visitors stay engaged. Whether you want to highlight your latest case studies, share client testimonials, or display your working history in a beautiful timeline, Adas has got you covered. One of the standout features is the built-in Dark and Light Mode toggle, allowing users to switch the website's visual vibe with just a single click. Powered by the powerful Kirki Customizer, you can easily tweak colors, typography, and layout settings in real-time without touching a single line of code."
    },
